	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Daisy-Chained Sensor Suite (Team Fulgora)\n\nSignal flow left to right: upstream SPI + power enter on the left, the RP2040 reads the six\nI2C devices and appends their data to the packet, then forwards it downstream.\nRequirements: pcb/README.md and the team Hardware Reference Manual (HRM)."
